    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 14 rooms, each concealing riddles and collectible objects, waiting to be unraveled by you. Whether you're new to escape games or a seasoned adventurer, the diverse puzzles will captivate you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All packed into a cute 3D isometric style, Tiny House is completely free to play, no In-app purchases are needed to complete the rooms. You can still remove Ads and support the development with an IAP of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the captivating 3D graphics that set Tiny House apart, blending classic point-and-click adventure with modern room escape mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny House is available in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, Japanese, Korean, and Portuguese. The game language automatically changes based on your OS language settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to let your friends know how far you've gone on the game, they may want to compete with you in this exciting escape room experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- What's an escape room game? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an escape game, you aim to break free from a trapped location by employing skill, patience, and logical thinking. By examining and interacting with objects, you gather clues and items essential for solving puzzles and ultimately escaping the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826220/extras/f221e128dbdeaebe6f4bbf6c8f11e2ae.avif?t=1751521611\" data-has-big width=800 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi there, <strong>Frank Eno</strong>'s here, I have been creating escape room and puzzle games since 2020 under the name of\u00a0 <strong>XSGames</strong>, doing all by myself: code, graphics, music, design, concept, etc.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 14 rooms, each concealing riddles and collectible objects, waiting to be unraveled by you. Whether you're new to escape games or a seasoned adventurer, the diverse puzzles will captivate you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All packed into a cute 3D isometric style, Tiny House is completely free to play, no In-app purchases are needed to complete the rooms. You can still remove Ads and support the development with an IAP of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the captivating 3D graphics that set Tiny House apart, blending classic point-and-click adventure with modern room escape mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiny House is available in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, Japanese, Korean, and Portuguese. The game language automatically changes based on your OS language settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to let your friends know how far you've gone on the game, they may want to compete with you in this exciting escape room experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- What's an escape room game? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an escape game, you aim to break free from a trapped location by employing skill, patience, and logical thinking. By examining and interacting with objects, you gather clues and items essential for solving puzzles and ultimately escaping the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2826220/extras/f221e128dbdeaebe6f4bbf6c8f11e2ae.avif?t=1751521611\" data-has-big width=800 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi there, <strong>Frank Eno</strong>'s here, I have been creating escape room and puzzle games since 2020 under the name of\u00a0 <strong>XSGames</strong>, doing all by myself: code, graphics, music, design, concept, etc.</p>",
